# Battery care (docs/BATTERY.md "Battery care"): upower offers its charge
# limit (GNOME Settings, Power: "Preserve battery health") for a battery
# with CHARGE_LIMIT=start,end. The kernel's max77705_charger adds the
# charge_control_*_threshold controls to the gauge. upower's own default
# (60-upower-battery.rules, hwdb: 75,80 for every battery) is replaced here,
# hence 61-: charging pauses at 85 %, Samsung's "Protect battery" level,
# and resumes at 80 %.
ACTION!="remove", SUBSYSTEM=="power_supply", KERNEL=="max170xx_battery", TEST=="charge_control_end_threshold", ENV{CHARGE_LIMIT}="80,85"
